{"node_id": "nd002", "text": "Need for control", "depth": 2, "parent_id": null, "status": "confirmed", "confidence": 0.85, "confidence_raw": 0.85, "supporting_spans": [{"session_id": "p000156-calib_dec_ungated-s1", "turn_index": 1, "quote": "Keeps messing with my expectations.", "char_start": 60, "char_end": 95}, {"session_id": "p000156-calib_dec_ungated-s1", "turn_index": 5, "quote": "It's been a pattern. I ordered something important, and it’s late.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 66}, {"session_id": "p000156-calib_dec_ungated-s1", "turn_index": 5, "quote": "Makes me feel ignored, like my plans mean nothing.", "char_start": 67, "char_end": 117}, {"session_id": "p000156-calib_dec_ungated-s2", "turn_index": 1, "quote": "The mail still isn't consistent. I ordered something important, but the mailman skipped my place again. Frustrating, really.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 124}, {"session_id": "p000156-calib_dec_ungated-s2", "turn_index": 3, "quote": "Maybe I'll just keep tracking it myself.", "char_start": 63, "char_end": 103}, {"session_id": "p000156-calib_dec_ungated-s2", "turn_index": 11, "quote": "I'll look online first, but it does feel like a hassle for something that might not matter in the end.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 102}, {"session_id": "p000156-calib_dec_ungated-s3", "turn_index": 1, "quote": "The mail still hasn't come, and I feel like it's letting me down.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 65}, {"session_id": "p000156-calib_dec_ungated-s3", "turn_index": 5, "quote": "It’s like my plans got messed up because of this.", "char_start": 47, "char_end": 96}, {"session_id": "p000156-calib_dec_ungated-s3", "turn_index": 5, "quote": "I just keep checking and getting disappointed.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 46}, {"session_id": "p000156-calib_dec_ungated-s3", "turn_index": 7, "quote": "It’s really been on my mind. I check my mail constantly, feeling like I should have heard something by now.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 107}, {"session_id": "p000156-cali